OL,5,G1530 Heart and Soul
OL,6,     FDavid Eubank calls himself a
OL,7,     FChristian missionary, not a
OL,8,     Fsoldier. But in the war zones of
OL,9,     FBurma and Iraq, he has rescued the
OL,10,     Fwounded, carried the dead, and
OL,11,     Fkilled.
OL,12,G1600 Beryl Cook: Artist or Entertainer?
OL,13,     FA shy, self-taught, gloriously
OL,14,     Frude seaside landlady. But was she
OL,15,     Fa serious artist? In Beryl Cook's
OL,16,     Fcentenary year, Louisa Buck heads
OL,17,     Fto Plymouth to find out.
